                        "description": "Login to get bearer token for subsequent requests\n\nResponse will contain:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"user\": {...},\n    \"token\": \"<BEARER_TOKEN>\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Copy the token and paste it in the Collection Auth tab**"
