        {
            "name": "1. WORKFLOW: Submit Hồ Sơ (Day 2)",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Submit Hồ Sơ + Upload Minh Chứng",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "exec": [
                                    "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                                    "  var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                    "  pm.environment.set('ma_ho_so', jsonData.data.ma_ho_so);",
                                    "  pm.test('Hồ sơ submitted successfully', function() {",
                                    "    pm.expect(jsonData.success).to.be.true;",
                                    "  });",
                                    "  pm.test('MaHoSo saved to environment', function() {",
                                    "    pm.expect(pm.environment.get('ma_ho_so')).to.exist;",
                                    "  });",
                                    "}"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "formdata",
                            "formdata": [
                                {
                                    "key": "ma_loai_cs",
                                    "value": "1",
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "description": "1 = MGHP (BM.01), 2 = TCXH (BM.02)"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "ma_dot",
                                    "value": "1",
                                    "type": "text"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "form_data",
                                    "value": "{\"ho_ten\":\"Nguyễn Văn A\",\"ma_so_sv\":\"20210001\",\"dien_thoai\":\"0901234567\",\"trang_thai_ho_gia_dinh\":\"hộ_nghèo\",\"ghi_chu\":\"Gia đình hộ nghèo\"}",
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "description": "JSON string with form data"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "minh_chungs",
                                    "type": "file",
                                    "src": [],
                                    "description": "Upload image file (CCCD, Hộ Khẩu, etc.)"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/ho-so/store",
                            "protocol": "http",
                            "host": [
                                "localhost"
                            ],
                            "port": "8000",
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "ho-so",
                                "store"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Submit a new hồ sơ with form data and minh chứng images\n\n**Steps**:\n1. Fill in form_data JSON\n2. Upload minh chứng file(s)\n3. Send request\n4. Note the `ma_ho_so` from response\n\n**Response Example**:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"ma_ho_so\": 1,\n    \"ma_loai_cs\": 1,\n    \"ma_trang_thai\": 2,\n    \"du_lieu_form\": {...},\n    \"minh_chungs\": [{...}]\n  },\n  \"message\": \"Nộp hồ sơ thành công. Vui lòng chờ xét duyệt.\"\n}\n```"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "2. VERIFY: Get Hồ Sơ Details",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Get Hồ Sơ Chi Tiết",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('Get hồ sơ details successfully', function() {",
                                    "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200);",
                                    "  var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                    "  pm.expect(jsonData.success).to.be.true;",
                                    "  pm.expect(jsonData.data.MaHoSo).to.exist;",
                                    "  pm.expect(jsonData.data.du_lieu_form).to.exist;",
                                    "});"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/ho-so/{{ma_ho_so}}",
                            "protocol": "http",
                            "host": [
                                "localhost"
                            ],
                            "port": "8000",
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "ho-so",
                                "{{ma_ho_so}}"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Get full details of the hồ sơ including minh chứng files\n\n**Uses variable**: `{{ma_ho_so}}` (set from previous request)"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "3. DAY 3 MAIN: Process OCR",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "POST Trigger OCR Processing",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('OCR Processing successful', function() {",
                                    "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200);",
                                    "  var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                    "  pm.expect(jsonData.success).to.be.true;",
                                    "});",
                                    "",
                                    "pm.test('Analysis results returned', function() {",
                                    "  var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                    "  pm.expect(jsonData.data.analysis_results).to.be.an('array');",
                                    "  pm.expect(jsonData.data.analysis_results.length).to.be.greaterThan(0);",
                                    "});",
                                    "",
                                    "pm.test('Each analysis has required fields', function() {",
                                    "  var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                    "  jsonData.data.analysis_results.forEach(function(result) {",
                                    "    pm.expect(result.ma_minh_chung).to.exist;",
                                    "    pm.expect(result.ma_phan_tich).to.exist;",
                                    "    pm.expect(result.ty_le_khop).to.be.a('number');",
                                    "    pm.expect(result.trang_thai).to.be.oneOf(['APPROVED', 'WARNING', 'NEED_REVIEW']);",
                                    "    pm.expect(result.khuyến_nghị).to.be.a('string');",
                                    "  });",
                                    "});"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"process_all\": false\n}"
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/ho-so/{{ma_ho_so}}/process-ocr",
                            "protocol": "http",
                            "host": [
                                "localhost"
                            ],
                            "port": "8000",
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "ho-so",
                                "{{ma_ho_so}}",
                                "process-ocr"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "**Trigger OCR processing for the hồ sơ**\n\nThis is the main Day 3 endpoint. It:\n1. Retrieves all minh chứng for the hồ sơ\n2. Calls Gemini Vision API to extract data from images\n3. Compares extracted data with form_data using ComparisonService\n4. Saves results to PHAN_TICH_AI_HO_SO table\n5. Auto-updates HoSo.MaTrangThai based on match rate:\n   - All APPROVED (>=95%) → Status 4 (Chờ Trưởng phòng)\n   - Has errors (<80%) → Status 3 (Đang bổ sung)\n   - Has warnings (80-95%) → Status 2 (Chờ thẩm định)\n\n**Expected Response** (200 OK):\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"ma_ho_so\": 1,\n    \"analysis_count\": 2,\n    \"analysis_results\": [\n      {\n        \"ma_minh_chung\": 10,\n        \"ma_phan_tich\": 15,\n        \"ty_le_khop\": 0.98,\n        \"trang_thai\": \"APPROVED\",\n        \"khuyến_nghị\": \"✅ Tự động duyệt hồ sơ - Dữ liệu trùng khớp hoàn toàn (98%)\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"ma_minh_chung\": 11,\n        \"ma_phan_tich\": 16,\n        \"ty_le_khop\": 0.85,\n        \"trang_thai\": \"WARNING\",\n        \"khuyến_nghị\": \"⚠️ Xét duyệt có điều kiện - Kiểm tra lại các trường: ho_ten\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"message\": \"Xử lý OCR hoàn thành thành công\"\n}\n```\n\n**Key Response Fields**:\n- `ma_phan_tich`: ID for querying detailed results from PHAN_TICH_AI_HO_SO\n- `ty_le_khop`: Match rate (0-1), used to determine status\n- `trang_thai`: APPROVED, WARNING, or NEED_REVIEW\n- `khuyến_nghị`: Human-readable recommendation for admin"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "4. VERIFY: Check Updated Hồ Sơ Status",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Get Updated Hồ Sơ (Check Auto-Status)",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('Status should be updated', function() {",
                                    "  var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                    "  var maTrangThai = jsonData.data.MaTrangThai;",
                                    "  pm.expect([2, 3, 4]).to.include(maTrangThai);",
                                    "});"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/ho-so/{{ma_ho_so}}",
                            "protocol": "http",
                            "host": [
                                "localhost"
                            ],
                            "port": "8000",
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "ho-so",
                                "{{ma_ho_so}}"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Verify hồ sơ status was auto-updated after OCR:\n- **Status 4**: Chờ Trưởng phòng (all APPROVED)\n- **Status 3**: Đang bổ sung (has errors)\n- **Status 2**: Chờ thẩm định (has warnings)"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "5. DATABASE: Query OCR Results",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "[Reference] Query PHAN_TICH_AI_HO_SO via SQL",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/",
                            "protocol": "http",
                            "host": [
                                "localhost"
                            ],
                            "port": "8000",
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                ""
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "**REFERENCE ONLY** - Execute this SQL to see OCR analysis results:\n\n```sql\nSELECT \n  MaPhanTich,\n  MaHoSo,\n  LoaiTaiLieuOCR,\n  TyLeKhop,\n  DoTinCayOCR,\n  TrangThaiXuLy,\n  KetQuaDoiChieu,\n  ThoiGianPhanTich\nFROM PHAN_TICH_AI_HO_SO\nWHERE MaHoSo = {{ma_ho_so}}\nORDER BY ThoiGianPhanTich DESC;\n```\n\n**Query Results will show**:\n- Match rate for each minh chứng\n- Status classification (APPROVED/WARNING/NEED_REVIEW)\n- Confidence scores from Gemini\n- Detailed comparison results in JSON\n- Processing timestamp"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
