                            ],
                            "port": "8000",
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "ho-so",
                                "store"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Test Scenario 2: Minor Discrepancy\n\n**Expected Outcome**:\n- After OCR: `ty_le_khop ≈ 0.85-0.95` (80-95%)\n- Status: `WARNING`\n- HoSo stays Status 2 (admin review needed)\n- `CanBaoLech` shows: accent difference in name\n\n**Test Steps**:\n1. Run this request\n2. Copy `ma_ho_so` from response\n3. Run OCR endpoint\n4. Verify `trang_thai = WARNING` in results\n5. Check `CanBaoLech` for discrepancy details"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Scenario 3: Major Discrepancy (NEED_REVIEW)",
                    "request": {
