                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "minh_chungs",
                                    "type": "file",
                                    "src": [],
                                    "description": "Upload CCCD with different name/ID (e.g., Nguyễn Văn A / 20210001)"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/ho-so/store",
                            "protocol": "http",
                            "host": [
                                "localhost"
                            ],
                            "port": "8000",
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "ho-so",
                                "store"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Test Scenario 3: Major Discrepancy\n\n**Expected Outcome**:\n- After OCR: `ty_le_khop < 0.80` (less than 80%)\n- Status: `NEED_REVIEW`\n- HoSo auto-updates to Status 3 (Đang bổ sung)\n- Multiple entries in `CanBaoLech`\n\n**Test Steps**:\n1. Run this request\n2. Copy `ma_ho_so` from response\n3. Run OCR endpoint\n4. Verify `trang_thai = NEED_REVIEW` in results\n5. Verify HoSo status changed to 3\n6. Check `CanBaoLech` shows multiple discrepancies"
                    }
